; PT35 (#932): the result of AutoCAD 2021 for autocad-rectang.scr (Matleyx78/dxf-test-file,
; commit 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736, CC0-1.0; docs/tappe/0.8.1/dxf-di-prova.md).
; The expected values of the rectang/ scripts come from here; the Oracolo ezdxf step of the CI
; compares these answers with ezdxf. Every RECTANG writes group 43 (constant width), also when 0.
D = DXF source=autocad-rectang
? version D -> AC1032
? units D -> 4
? count D -> LWPOLYLINE 10
? unhandled D -> none
; a: plain, from 0,0 to 40,20
? entity D 8C -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=0,0 vertex=40,0 vertex=40,20 vertex=0,20
; b: Chamfer 3 and 5: 3 on the vertical side, 5 on the horizontal one
? entity D 8D -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=60,3 vertex=65,0 vertex=97,0 vertex=100,5 vertex=100,17 vertex=95,20 vertex=63,20 vertex=60,15
; c: Fillet 4, bulge tan(22.5 degrees)
? entity D 8E -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=120,4 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=124,0 vertex=156,0 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=160,4 vertex=160,16 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=156,20 vertex=124,20 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=120,16
; d: Width 1
? entity D 8F -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes width=1 vertex=180,0 vertex=220,0 vertex=220,20 vertex=180,20
; e: Area 600 from the length 30
? entity D 90 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=240,0 vertex=270,0 vertex=270,20 vertex=240,20
; f: Dimensions 40 x 20, towards 350,30
? entity D 91 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=300,0 vertex=340,0 vertex=340,20 vertex=300,20
; h: Elevation 5 (group 38)
? entity D 92 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=360,0 vertex=400,0 vertex=400,20 vertex=360,20 elevation=5
; i: Thickness 2 (group 39)
? entity D 93 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=420,0 vertex=460,0 vertex=460,20 vertex=420,20 thickness=2
; k: from the top right corner to the bottom left one: both sizes negative, counterclockwise
? entity D 94 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=520,20 vertex=480,20 vertex=480,0 vertex=520,0
; g: Rotation 30, then Dimensions 40 x 20, towards 590,40
? entity D 95 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=540,0 vertex=574.6410161513775,20.00000000000001 vertex=564.6410161513776,37.32050807568877 vertex=530,17.32050807568876
